					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5485</guid>
				<title>SCP-5485</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5485</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5485&lt;br /&gt;
The normal man&lt;br /&gt;
Object class: safe
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5485 is a 23 year old white male named [redacted].&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Those who have interacted with [redacted] have described it as unremarkable and boring in every way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[Redacted] was brought into containment in it&#039;s sleep after foundation staff discovered it&#039;s anomolous aura of normalcy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Class A amnestics were administered to those who saw him often enough to notice his disappearance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any humans within 10 feet of [redacted] will become incredibly boring for anywhere between a few hours to a week.&lt;br /&gt;
These people are referred to as SCP-5485-A.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In interviews with instances, no matter what the instance answered, all staff present agreed that it was the most boring answer possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[Redacted]&#039;s aura also nullifies anomolies within it, although the effects end immediately after the anomoly exits the area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-173 appears to be completely unable to kill [redacted] as once if is within it&#039;s aura, it immediately becomes a normal statue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instances of SCP-5485-A have been cited as making simple drawings of objects or people around in the event there is no other form of entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In a particular experiment, an instance was placed in a sealed room with nothing inside it other than a pencil and paper&lt;br /&gt;
After [redacted] hours, a foundation staff member entered the sealed chamber and when the drawing was observed, it was found that it had drawn the two foundation staff members instructed to observe the security footage during the experiment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any and all security footage, even thermal and sonar, observing [redacted] is seen to become monochromatic so long as the camera itself is within it&#039;s aura.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experiments on the inventions of DR. Wondertainment, including but not limited to, robo dude, chore buddy, and the dragonsnails, with the effects of SCP-5485&#039;s aura have been conducted, although in all experiments, the inventions have not been effected by the aura at all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[Redacted] is to be kept in a containment facility that replicates the living room in someone&#039;s home in the 1980s-1990s&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[Redacted] makes no efforts to escape, but will occasionally complain about being contained in a plain, monotone voice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The above statement also applies to instances of SCP-5485-A&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5485 is a completely normal man.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/boopdoople&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7164282&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609318836&quot; alt=&quot;Boopdoople&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7164282)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/boopdoople&quot;  &gt;Boopdoople&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 30 Dec 2020 07:34:00 +0000</pubDate>
