periments, the inventions have not been effected by the aura at all.</p> <p>[Redacted] is to be kept in a containment facility that replicates the living room in someone's home in the 1980s-1990s</p> <p>[Redacted] makes no efforts to escape, but will occasionally complain about being contained in a plain, monotone voice.</p> <p>The above statement also applies to instances of SCP-5485-A</p> <p>SCP-5485 is a completely normal man.</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/boopdoople" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7164282&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609318836" alt="Boopdoople" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7164282)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/boopdoople" >Boopdoople</a></span></p> 
