&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-451792-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Absorbed Threat Organization&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-451792-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. No source indicating their possession of an actual doctorate has been found as of writing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-451792-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. Formerly designated UTE-7198-Parallax Kenner &amp;quot;Wonder World&amp;quot;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-451792-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. Censorship was not done by PTOLEMY Division, and is speculated to be due to nomenclatural thaumaturgy. As it has shown no signs of cognitive or memetic hazards, it has been retained.&lt;/div&gt;
