&lt;td&gt;From: &lt;span style=&quot;color: blue&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;wiki-email&quot;&gt;cog.viDYMELOTP|drahciRDD#cog.viDYMELOTP|drahciRDD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Director,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our agents have been compromised. Bellfather are aware of my location. Requesting immediate reinforcements and extraction.&lt;/p&gt;
