&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;NOTICE FROM THE FOUNDATION RECORDS AND INFORMATION SECURITY ADMINISTRATION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I don&#039;t know who you are, and you will never know who I am. That&#039;s fine. But we&#039;re on the same side. I have to be fast about this:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;I&#039;ve included everything I could recover after the church fire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Olney is complicit, but I doubt they&#039;ll be of much help to you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;I don&#039;t think this is the root of the problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;#8212; [INVALID ID]&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

